WEBVTT

00:03.260 --> 00:06.510
<b>Come take a look, everyone!
This is a self-spinning millstone!</b>

00:06.510 --> 00:08.770
<b>This'll make grinding powder easy!</b>

00:08.770 --> 00:12.140
<b>The Item Box magic on this
will let you carry 300 arrows!</b>

00:12.140 --> 00:17.400
<b>If that's not enough for you,
just give up hunting with a bow!</b>

00:17.400 --> 00:19.740
<b>We've put some good magic on these!</b>

00:19.740 --> 00:24.530
<b>They cut well, guaranteed to
increase work efficiency!</b>

00:26.490 --> 00:29.490
<b>So this is the magic item market!</b>

00:33.540 --> 00:37.460
<b>Hey, Mr. Serge. And Ryoma, too!</b>

00:37.460 --> 00:38.590
<b>Welcome.</b>

00:38.590 --> 00:39.880
<b>Good morning.</b>

00:39.880 --> 00:42.170
<b>Take your time, look around.</b>

00:42.170 --> 00:44.760
<b>Mr. Dinome, I'm sorry to be so blunt,</b>

00:44.760 --> 00:47.760
<b>but there's a business proposition
that I'd like to discuss in depth.</b>

00:47.760 --> 00:52.520
<b>Hmm? Sure, let's talk inside, then.</b>

00:52.520 --> 00:53.730
<b>Yes.</b>

00:58.940 --> 01:00.150
<b>Who are you?</b>

01:00.150 --> 01:01.780
<b>Um...</b>

01:01.780 --> 01:05.320
<b>This is Fedele, the grandson
I told you about yesterday.</b>

01:09.120 --> 01:12.540
<b>I'm Ryoma. Nice to meet you, Fedele.</b>

01:12.540 --> 01:14.710
<b>Ryoma? Let's play.</b>

01:14.710 --> 01:19.710
<b>I'll talk to Mr. Serge. Could you
take care of Fedele in the meantime?</b>

01:19.710 --> 01:22.670
<b>He seems to like you.</b>

01:22.670 --> 01:24.470
<b>Understood.</b>

01:27.260 --> 01:29.050
<b>Let's play.</b>

01:29.050 --> 01:30.510
<b>What should we play?</b>

01:30.510 --> 01:33.730
<b>Let's play word connection!
Start with "M" for "Magic item"!</b>

01:33.730 --> 01:36.400
<b>Um... "Myself"?</b>

01:36.400 --> 01:39.020
<b>"F"... "Fedele"!</b>

01:39.020 --> 01:42.150
<b>"E"... "Egg"...?</b>

01:42.150 --> 01:43.440
<b>"G"...</b>

01:45.280 --> 01:48.620
<b>He doesn't seem to be enjoying this.</b>

01:48.620 --> 01:50.240
<b>"G"...</b>

01:51.200 --> 01:57.620
<b>Even if he wanted to play outside,
he can't just wander off into the crowd.</b>

01:57.620 --> 01:59.840
<b>"G"... "Glass."</b>

01:59.840 --> 02:03.340
<b>Maybe there aren't any toys
for him to play with here.</b>

02:03.340 --> 02:05.670
<b>In that case, I have an idea.</b>

02:08.470 --> 02:12.850
<b>Excuse me, can I borrow this trash bucket?</b>

02:12.850 --> 02:13.810
<b>Sure.</b>

02:13.810 --> 02:16.390
<b>Ryoma, it's "S."</b>

02:16.390 --> 02:17.560
<b>"Sand."</b>

02:17.560 --> 02:22.480
<b>"D"... "D"... "Doorknob."</b>

02:22.480 --> 02:24.150
<b>"B," right?</b>

02:27.950 --> 02:30.530
<b>This is called a <i>beigoma</i>.</b>

02:30.530 --> 02:34.450
<b>I accept the terms for
the commission as you suggested.</b>

02:34.450 --> 02:35.700
<b>Thank you.</b>

02:35.700 --> 02:41.210
<b>This really is well-made.
I can't wait to work on it.</b>

02:46.130 --> 02:47.470
<b>Good.</b>

02:50.800 --> 02:54.220
<b>See? Hold it like this, and there!</b>

02:58.390 --> 03:00.730
<b>There! Oh...</b>

03:00.730 --> 03:02.690
<b>Here, let me try.</b>

03:03.690 --> 03:06.820
<b>He accepted the music box deal.</b>

03:06.820 --> 03:08.700
<b>Thank you!</b>

03:08.700 --> 03:15.200
<b>Don't mention it. We'll be
making money, too, so it's a fair deal.</b>

03:15.200 --> 03:16.700
<b>There.</b>

03:18.370 --> 03:20.580
<b>You've played with <i>beigomas</i> before?</b>

03:20.580 --> 03:24.630
<b>No, I just copied you.</b>

03:24.630 --> 03:25.670
<b>What?!</b>

03:25.670 --> 03:29.720
<b>How long do you think
I've lived as a craftsman?</b>

03:29.720 --> 03:32.760
<b>This is easy once I've seen it in action!</b>

03:32.760 --> 03:34.300
<b>Grandpa, you're awesome!</b>

03:34.300 --> 03:36.390
<b>You think so?</b>

03:36.390 --> 03:38.350
<b>Thanks!</b>

03:40.390 --> 03:43.940
<b>I'll leave a set here, please enjoy.</b>

03:43.940 --> 03:44.770
<b>You sure?</b>

03:44.770 --> 03:48.320
<b>Yes. I'm sure Fedele wants to
play with his grandpa, right?</b>

03:48.320 --> 03:50.990
<b>Yes! Yay!</b>

03:52.280 --> 03:56.620
<b>Right! I'll take it, then. Thanks!</b>

03:57.580 --> 04:01.080
<b>Dear Lady Eliaria Jamil.</b>

04:01.080 --> 04:06.500
<b>I saw many interesting items
at the magic items market,</b>

04:06.500 --> 04:11.840
<b>but the most memorable image was that of
the smiles of Mr. Dinome and Fedele.</b>

04:12.800 --> 04:16.640
<b>I didn't think they would enjoy
that toy I quickly put together</b>

04:16.640 --> 04:21.270
<b>from the leftover material
from the music box.</b>

05:51.980 --> 05:56.990
"Episode 6"
"Ryoma and the Magic Item Market"

05:51.990 --> 05:57.000
<b>"Episode 6"
"Ryoma and the Magic Item Market"</b>

06:01.410 --> 06:02.950
<b>I'm home.</b>

06:06.920 --> 06:10.090
<b>It's quite late; I should sleep now.</b>

06:12.000 --> 06:17.430
<b>The slime that ate the charcoal--
it's starting to evolve!</b>

06:20.760 --> 06:24.770
<b>It's done. Monster Appraisal.</b>

06:27.140 --> 06:29.480
<b>Deodorant slime.</b>

06:29.480 --> 06:34.190
<b>Skills are displace odor, deodorize,
resist odor, absorb odor...</b>

06:34.190 --> 06:40.240
<b>It's similar to the cleaner slime,
but more focused on odor.</b>

06:40.240 --> 06:42.530
<b>Let's study it further.</b>

06:43.240 --> 06:47.330
<b>And so you came here after that,
without sleeping at all?</b>

06:47.330 --> 06:50.040
<b>Well, yes.</b>

06:50.040 --> 06:52.090
<b>Anyway!</b>

06:52.090 --> 06:56.340
<b>I want to run some experiments using
the fluid produced by the deodorant slime,</b>

06:56.340 --> 06:58.510
<b>which should absorb odors.</b>

06:59.380 --> 07:01.260
<b>This is the fluid?</b>

07:01.260 --> 07:05.640
<b>Yes. The bags contain cotton
dipped in the odor absorption solution.</b>

07:05.640 --> 07:09.690
<b>So you want us to put these bags
in different areas of the shop?</b>

07:09.690 --> 07:14.610
<b>I think the odor absorption limit differs
depending on the amount of solution.</b>

07:14.610 --> 07:18.450
<b>I have nothing but respect
for your passion towards research.</b>

07:18.450 --> 07:20.950
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:20.950 --> 07:25.290
<b>I want to ask around to see if anyone
can help with the experiment,</b>

07:25.290 --> 07:26.870
<b>so I'll be off now.</b>

07:26.870 --> 07:28.330
<b>Understood.</b>

07:28.330 --> 07:32.540
<b>But please do go home as soon as possible
and get some rest.</b>

07:32.540 --> 07:34.340
<b>I'll try...</b>

07:40.720 --> 07:43.090
<b>Let's hope we can
make some tasty charcoal.</b>

07:44.010 --> 07:48.930
<b>I feel bad for Mr. Callum, but I want to
stockpile some feed before I go to sleep.</b>

07:50.940 --> 07:53.730
<b>The more they eat,
the faster they multiply.</b>

07:53.730 --> 07:57.030
<b>Once the deodorant slimes stabilize, then...</b>

08:04.870 --> 08:07.370
<b>I see them playing like that a lot.</b>

08:07.370 --> 08:09.120
<b>I wonder if that's any fun.</b>

08:15.670 --> 08:17.250
<b>The iron and metal slimes</b>

08:17.250 --> 08:21.220
<b>can maintain their metallic properties
while changing shape.</b>

08:25.180 --> 08:27.680
<b>In that case, perhaps...</b>

08:32.600 --> 08:34.190
<b>This might work.</b>

08:49.830 --> 08:54.120
<b>If I finish this more carefully, I should
be able to get it to become sharper!</b>

08:54.120 --> 08:58.210
<b>This should help me
in the Great Forest of Schluss!</b>

08:58.210 --> 09:01.720
<b>Right, let's finish this up
before morning!</b>

09:02.260 --> 09:05.260
<b>Manager, did you pull another all-nighter?</b>

09:05.260 --> 09:09.890
<b>No, not exactly.
I did get a full hour of sleep.</b>

09:11.100 --> 09:15.100
<b>Please take care of your health.</b>

09:15.100 --> 09:15.850
<b>--Being forced to pull
all-nighters was the worst,</b>

09:15.850 --> 09:18.190
<b>--Ryo-mya, where are you? Second floor?
--Being forced to pull
all-nighters was the worst,</b>

09:18.190 --> 09:21.110
<b>--Ryo-mya, where are you? Second floor?
--but staying up to do
things I enjoy is fun...</b>

09:21.110 --> 09:22.190
<b>--All right, Ryo-mya, you here?
--but staying up to do
things I enjoy is fun...</b>

09:22.190 --> 09:25.160
<b>--All right, Ryo-mya, you here?
--But I probably shouldn't
say that out loud.</b>

09:25.160 --> 09:26.990
<b>Ryo-mya?</b>

09:26.990 --> 09:28.280
<b>Come in.</b>

09:30.580 --> 09:32.330
<b>Sorry to bust in!</b>

09:32.330 --> 09:36.420
<b>I want more of these
smell-cleaning bags right away!</b>

09:36.420 --> 09:41.050
<b>Miss Miya, thank you for
helping with the experiment.</b>

09:41.050 --> 09:42.630
<b>So the effect wore off?</b>

09:42.630 --> 09:46.010
<b>Yeah. The day before yesterday, at noon,
I put it in the trash heap.</b>

09:46.010 --> 09:49.760
<b>The smell was totally gone
until this morning, but...</b>

09:49.760 --> 09:51.850
<b>Let me take a look.</b>

09:54.810 --> 10:00.190
<b>It seems it absorbed the maximum
amount of smell and lost its effect.</b>

10:00.190 --> 10:01.860
<b>I'll get you some more
odor absorption solution,</b>

10:01.860 --> 10:05.820
<b>and also a sample of
a new deodorizing solution.</b>

10:05.820 --> 10:08.870
<b>Should I place both
in the same place as before?</b>

10:08.870 --> 10:10.950
<b>Yes, please.</b>

10:12.240 --> 10:14.910
<b>I personally want to see this
completed as soon as possible,</b>

10:14.910 --> 10:16.920
<b>so I'll help in any way I can!</b>

10:16.920 --> 10:18.880
<b>Th-Thank you.</b>

10:18.880 --> 10:24.760
<b>Your new item will greatly improve
the lives of cat beastkin!</b>

10:24.760 --> 10:27.470
<b>I have nothing but
the highest hopes for it!</b>

10:27.470 --> 10:28.760
<b>Later!</b>

10:30.090 --> 10:34.770
<b>Hopefully, I can get this to market soon
by gathering data like this.</b>

10:36.350 --> 10:38.310
<b>Oh, it broke!</b>

10:38.310 --> 10:39.980
<b>Some trash fell.</b>

10:39.980 --> 10:44.860
<b>Come on, how am I supposed to get any
work done with a run-down cart like this?</b>

10:44.860 --> 10:49.990
<b>W-We have to.
We can't afford to buy a new one.</b>

10:49.990 --> 10:51.950
<b>Um...</b>

10:51.950 --> 10:54.410
<b>What do you want? This isn't a show.</b>

10:54.410 --> 10:56.620
<b>May I fix that cart for you?</b>

10:56.620 --> 10:58.160
<b>Huh?</b>

10:59.250 --> 11:00.420
<b>Please.</b>

11:08.090 --> 11:10.760
<b>It should be fine now.</b>

11:10.760 --> 11:13.300
<b>You're a tamer?</b>

11:13.300 --> 11:14.220
<b>Yes.</b>

11:14.220 --> 11:17.560
<b>Y-You seem to be the same age as us.</b>

11:18.560 --> 11:22.190
<b>Are you hauling trash as a job?</b>

11:22.190 --> 11:26.360
<b>Don't underestimate us.
He and I are adventurers.</b>

11:26.360 --> 11:28.740
<b>Rank G, though.</b>

11:28.740 --> 11:32.120
<b>These kids can't do any real work yet,</b>

11:32.120 --> 11:35.660
<b>but carrying trash to the disposal
facility is worth some money.</b>

11:35.660 --> 11:40.160
<b>As a fellow slum resident,
we're looking after them.</b>

11:41.210 --> 11:43.540
<b>So they help each other to survive.</b>

11:43.540 --> 11:46.090
<b>Why are you looking at us like that?</b>

11:46.090 --> 11:49.420
<b>Oh, I was wondering
if I could ask you for a favor.</b>

11:49.420 --> 11:51.430
<b>Is it money? Cuz we don't have any.</b>

11:51.430 --> 11:53.260
<b>Item Box.</b>

11:55.850 --> 11:58.310
<b>You can use magic, too?!</b>

12:01.560 --> 12:04.360
<b>The garbage smell is gone.</b>

12:04.360 --> 12:06.860
<b>I need help with an experiment.</b>

12:06.860 --> 12:10.450
<b>I want to know how long these last
before the effect wears off.</b>

12:10.450 --> 12:12.320
<b>Yeah, we can do that.</b>

12:12.320 --> 12:14.740
<b>Th-Thank you!</b>

12:14.740 --> 12:19.910
<b>I'm Ryoma Takebayashi. You can contact me
at that laundry service there.</b>

12:19.910 --> 12:21.710
<b>I'm Beck.</b>

12:21.710 --> 12:23.330
<b>I'm Wist.</b>

12:23.330 --> 12:27.300
<b>We have to thank you,
after what you did for us.</b>

12:27.300 --> 12:28.710
<b>Please, it's fine.</b>

12:28.710 --> 12:32.510
<b>Just shut up and come with me.
I'll hook you up with a good deal.</b>

12:32.510 --> 12:34.550
<b>A good deal...</b>

12:34.550 --> 12:37.180
<b>Grandpa is so cool!</b>

12:40.180 --> 12:41.850
<b>We're supposed to
make up our own lines here.</b>

12:41.850 --> 12:44.480
<b>I'm not good at that.</b>

12:44.480 --> 12:48.270
<b>A good deal, at the church?</b>

12:48.270 --> 12:52.650
<b>Once every two months, they hand out
free snacks if we help clean the place.</b>

12:52.650 --> 12:54.280
<b>Today's that day.</b>

12:54.280 --> 12:55.700
<b>I see.</b>

12:55.700 --> 12:59.620
<b>Snacks for free,
that's my way of showing thanks.</b>

12:59.620 --> 13:01.620
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:01.620 --> 13:04.670
<b>A community service activity
type of thing, I guess.</b>

13:04.670 --> 13:07.090
<b>It's a good opportunity. I should help.</b>

13:13.260 --> 13:14.930
<b>Where am I?</b>

13:18.430 --> 13:21.720
<b>I see. I was able to summon you, too.</b>

13:36.450 --> 13:38.240
<b>Nice to meet you, I'm--</b>

13:38.240 --> 13:42.200
<b>I've heard about you.
You're the latest transfer.</b>

13:42.200 --> 13:45.710
<b>Word is, you're quite interesting.</b>

13:45.710 --> 13:50.880
<b>Another god. But I didn't
pray today, so why...</b>

13:50.880 --> 13:55.220
<b>I am Fernobelia,
god of magic and academics.</b>

13:55.220 --> 13:59.140
<b>This is my realm. You will be able to
go back once the time is right,</b>

13:59.140 --> 14:01.470
<b>so you may relax while you're here.</b>

14:01.470 --> 14:03.310
<b>Thank you.</b>

14:03.310 --> 14:08.480
<b>This must be the god that Tekun mentioned,
the one who's hard to track down.</b>

14:08.480 --> 14:10.730
<b>He does seem a bit grumpy.</b>

14:10.730 --> 14:14.240
<b>I want to ask you a few questions.
Is that all right?</b>

14:14.240 --> 14:15.320
<b>Yes.</b>

14:15.320 --> 14:19.490
<b>What was your original world like?</b>

14:19.490 --> 14:24.830
<b>It's hard to explain in brief,
but my previous world was...</b>

14:27.830 --> 14:31.630
<b>Next question. What is your favorite food?</b>

14:31.630 --> 14:34.260
<b>Huh? Food?</b>

14:34.260 --> 14:36.840
<b>What is your opinion on academics?</b>

14:37.590 --> 14:39.510
<b>On romance?</b>

14:42.890 --> 14:46.730
<b>Um, I haven't even answered
the first question yet...</b>

14:46.730 --> 14:49.100
<b>I appreciate your cooperation.</b>

14:50.900 --> 14:57.740
<b>As you surmised, when you reacted to
my words, your heart already had the answers.</b>

14:57.740 --> 15:00.070
<b>I took the liberty of reading them.</b>

15:00.070 --> 15:03.160
<b>My apologies. I was being
somewhat cautious.</b>

15:03.160 --> 15:04.330
<b>Cautious?</b>

15:04.330 --> 15:10.170
<b>Unfortunately, not all transfers are like you.</b>

15:10.170 --> 15:13.420
<b>Some become addicted to power
and commit crimes.</b>

15:13.420 --> 15:17.970
<b>Others unwittingly cause tragedies
by losing control of their powers.</b>

15:17.970 --> 15:21.720
<b>So that's why he wanted to study me first.</b>

15:25.600 --> 15:28.480
<b>You seem to sympathize with my point,
and I appreciate that.</b>

15:28.480 --> 15:34.230
<b>We never bring individuals with
clearly dangerous beliefs to our world.</b>

15:34.230 --> 15:39.070
<b>But there's no way for us to prevent
transfers from later turning evil.</b>

15:39.070 --> 15:41.530
<b>I'll do my best to make sure
that doesn't happen.</b>

15:41.530 --> 15:44.870
<b>It's unfortunate that
I can't say for sure, but...</b>

15:44.870 --> 15:48.790
<b>Those who casually make absolute
assurances are the least trustworthy.</b>

15:48.790 --> 15:52.830
<b>You appear to have
taken my words to heart.</b>

15:53.960 --> 15:57.920
<b>It's time. One final question.</b>

15:57.920 --> 16:01.180
<b>What is your opinion on this world?</b>

16:01.180 --> 16:04.720
<b>From the bottom of my heart,
I'm glad I came.</b>

16:10.180 --> 16:13.860
<b>Hey, what's wrong? Never cleaned before?</b>

16:13.860 --> 16:16.610
<b>Oh, I'm fine.</b>

16:16.610 --> 16:20.320
<b>I brought you all the way out here,
don't slack off.</b>

16:20.320 --> 16:22.570
<b>You're giving me a bad name.</b>

16:22.570 --> 16:26.870
<b>What kind of attitude is that,
when we're trying to thank him...?</b>

16:26.870 --> 16:29.160
<b>It's fine. Right, Ryoma?</b>

16:29.160 --> 16:30.370
<b>Yes.</b>

16:32.920 --> 16:37.090
<b>If I bring out the scavengers and cleaners,
this will be done instantly,</b>

16:37.090 --> 16:39.090
<b>but I'll use my own hands this time.</b>

16:40.420 --> 16:43.970
<b>It's done. Good job.</b>

16:43.970 --> 16:48.140
<b>Before we get our snacks,
there's actually one more good thing.</b>

16:48.140 --> 16:49.180
<b>Good thing?</b>

16:49.180 --> 16:53.390
<b>After we finish cleaning,
those who want it can get combat training.</b>

16:53.390 --> 16:57.060
<b>S-Someone from the Adventurer's Guild
comes to teach us,</b>

16:57.060 --> 17:02.070
<b>so that when we grow up,
we can live on our own.</b>

17:02.070 --> 17:06.740
<b>I didn't know the Adventurer's Guild
did that type of thing.</b>

17:06.740 --> 17:10.750
<b>Ryoma, if you learned to fight,
not just tame monsters,</b>

17:10.750 --> 17:12.540
<b>you can be an adventurer, too.</b>

17:12.540 --> 17:14.120
<b>He's here!</b>

17:14.120 --> 17:16.750
<b>It's scary-face man!</b>

17:20.800 --> 17:25.720
<b>Hey! Who said my face is scary?
That's not nice!</b>

17:25.720 --> 17:27.090
<b>Mr. Worgan?!</b>

17:27.090 --> 17:30.390
<b>Well, if it isn't Ryoma!
What are you doing here?</b>

17:30.390 --> 17:32.310
<b>I kind of ended up here.</b>

17:32.310 --> 17:37.060
<b>Ended up? Well, if you're here,
can you help out?</b>

17:37.060 --> 17:38.310
<b>Sure.</b>

17:38.310 --> 17:41.360
<b>You know the guild master?</b>

17:41.360 --> 17:43.900
<b>Yes, I receive his help a lot.</b>

17:43.900 --> 17:47.280
<b>D-Does that mean...</b>

17:47.280 --> 17:50.830
<b>Oh, you all just met.</b>

17:50.830 --> 17:53.330
<b>Ryoma is a rank E adventurer.</b>

17:53.330 --> 17:56.330
<b>What?!</b>

17:56.330 --> 17:58.540
<b>All right, let's begin!</b>

18:01.380 --> 18:03.260
<b>Don't just force everything!</b>

18:03.260 --> 18:08.180
<b>To fight monsters, you have to find
the opening to strike their weak spots!</b>

18:12.430 --> 18:15.690
<b>He can't score any hits,
but he's really strong.</b>

18:15.690 --> 18:18.190
<b>I can't believe he's around
the same age as me.</b>

18:21.860 --> 18:23.280
<b>Next! Beck, bring it!</b>

18:23.280 --> 18:25.400
<b>Yeah!</b>

18:28.410 --> 18:30.410
<b>Gotcha!</b>

18:30.410 --> 18:32.200
<b>Idiot!</b>

18:35.450 --> 18:38.620
<b>How many times do I have to tell you?
When you jump, you can't change your trajectory.</b>

18:41.630 --> 18:44.550
<b>Unless you come at me from outside
my vision, you'll never land a hit!</b>

18:44.550 --> 18:47.470
<b>But he's extremely athletic and nimble.</b>

18:47.470 --> 18:49.550
<b>How are things going over there, Ryoma?</b>

18:49.550 --> 18:51.260
<b>They're going well.</b>

18:54.430 --> 18:58.480
<b>I told them to just dodge
and do some light bumps.</b>

18:58.480 --> 19:02.150
<b>They won't cause anything
worse than a few scratches.</b>

19:02.150 --> 19:06.360
<b>They seem to make good
practice partners for the kids.</b>

19:06.360 --> 19:07.740
<b>Right, you're up.</b>

19:07.740 --> 19:08.950
<b>Huh?</b>

19:08.950 --> 19:13.740
<b>At the combat ability test, you used a bow,
but you can use swords, too, right?</b>

19:15.330 --> 19:16.950
<b>En garde!</b>

19:23.710 --> 19:26.510
<b>W-Wow...</b>

19:26.510 --> 19:30.470
<b>Just who <i>is</i> this Ryoma...?</b>

19:30.470 --> 19:34.060
<b>Thank you for teaching me a lot today.</b>

19:34.060 --> 19:36.640
<b>Ryoma, you're awesome!</b>

19:36.640 --> 19:40.980
<b>W-We'll try to become
adventurers like you!</b>

19:40.980 --> 19:42.520
<b>See ya!</b>

19:42.520 --> 19:44.650
<b>I'll let you know about
the odor absorption experiment!</b>

19:44.650 --> 19:47.110
<b>Yes, thank you!</b>

19:48.240 --> 19:50.150
<b>Good work.</b>

19:50.150 --> 19:52.740
<b>Would you like some tea?</b>

19:52.740 --> 19:54.370
<b>Yes, please.</b>

19:55.990 --> 20:00.710
<b>Ryoma, would you become
an instructor at the guild?</b>

20:00.710 --> 20:01.920
<b>Huh?</b>

20:01.920 --> 20:07.840
<b>You have what it takes. The slimes are
great training partners, too.</b>

20:07.840 --> 20:11.380
<b>I appreciate the offer,
but it's a bit too much for me.</b>

20:11.380 --> 20:15.430
<b>I'd first need to study how to teach
someone before I can start doing it.</b>

20:15.430 --> 20:17.680
<b>You're always so serious.</b>

20:17.680 --> 20:22.400
<b>I was surprised to see
that you teach children.</b>

20:22.400 --> 20:28.070
<b>It's the least I could do.
This church is run by just two nuns.</b>

20:28.070 --> 20:29.400
<b>Really?!</b>

20:29.400 --> 20:34.450
<b>Yes. But Mr. Worgan and
many other adults in town</b>

20:34.450 --> 20:37.240
<b>help us in many ways.</b>

20:37.240 --> 20:41.790
<b>You're still just a kid, but you were
on the helper side today.</b>

20:41.790 --> 20:44.420
<b>Thanks for your help.</b>

20:44.420 --> 20:47.920
<b>Help...? Me?</b>

20:47.920 --> 20:52.760
<b>After all the help and support
I've received till now...</b>

20:52.760 --> 20:55.390
<b>I'm now able to help others...</b>

20:55.390 --> 20:58.720
<b>If I can really do that...</b>

20:58.720 --> 21:02.390
<b>If I can really provide support
to the people of this town...</b>

21:02.390 --> 21:05.020
<b>That makes me feel quite good.</b>

21:05.020 --> 21:08.900
<b>Yeah. It's a good feeling.</b>

21:23.580 --> 21:25.830
<b>Mr. Ryoma, listen!</b>

21:25.830 --> 21:29.800
<b>I'm studying how to make sweets now!</b>

21:29.800 --> 21:33.380
<b>Once I go to the academy
in the royal capital and make friends,</b>

21:33.380 --> 21:37.890
<b>I want to make cakes to eat with them.</b>

21:38.890 --> 21:41.560
<b>I'm thinking, having a tea party
with handmade cakes</b>

21:41.560 --> 21:47.060
<b>would be a great way
to deepen my friendships.</b>

21:47.060 --> 21:52.110
<b>If my cakes are good,
I might get them to enjoy a lot.</b>

21:52.110 --> 21:56.490
<b>Mr. Ryoma, please eat my cake some day!</b>

22:00.620 --> 22:03.910
<b>Enjoy a lot...</b>

22:05.710 --> 22:08.540
<b>Yes, you're right, Elia.</b>

22:08.540 --> 22:10.540
<b></b>

22:10.540 --> 22:12.540
<b></b>
